    {
      "text": "Forest plot of sensitivity and specificity with 95% confidence intervals, for 8 studies of Xpert Ultra (adolescents only, per the caption). Sensitivities range from 0.67 to 1.00 with wide intervals (one not estimable) and specificities from 0.80 to 1.00.",
